---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Study — Vasad | અભ્યાસ"
	description="Education in Vasad: SVIT — engineering, architecture and nursing since 1997 — the Soil Conservation & Water Research Institute, and the town's 80% literacy record."
>
	<Nav />
	<main id="main" class="wrap">
		<header class="pagehead">
			<h1>The campus &amp; the classroom</h1>
			<p class="gu sub">અભ્યાસ — a market town that sends its children to college</p>
		</header>

		<section class="panel riveted svit" aria-labelledby="svit-h">
			<div class="svithead">
				<h2 id="svit-h">SVIT — Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Institute of Technology</h2>
				<span class="badge">Since 1997</span>
			</div>
			<p class="measure">
				The campus changed what this town is. Affiliated to Gujarat Technological University,
				SVIT runs undergraduate and postgraduate programs across three schools:
			</p>
			<ul class="schools">
				<li>Engineering</li>
				<li>Architecture</li>
				<li>Nursing</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="afternote">
				Students from across Gujarat study here — which is why the town keeps a PG and rooms
				wall on the <a href="/directory#stay">directory</a>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<div class="pair">
			<section class="panel riveted panel--green" id="research" aria-labelledby="inst-h">
				<h2 id="inst-h">Soil &amp; Water, studied here</h2>
				<p>
					The central government's <strong>Soil Conservation and Water Research Institute</strong> works from Vasad on the region's two hardest problems: holding the soil and keeping
					the water. Research that the farms around town feel.
				</p>
			</section>
			<section class="panel riveted panel--lacquer" aria-labelledby="lit-h">
				<h2 id="lit-h">The record on the wall</h2>
				<p class="big">80.12%</p>
				<p>
					The town's literacy at the 2011 Census — men at 84.18%, women at 75.66% — already
					above the state's bar, and rising since.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
	.pagehead {
		padding-top: 3rem;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
	}
	.sub {
		margin-top: 0.4rem;
		color: rgba(42, 39, 35, 0.8);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}
	.panel {
		padding: 2.1rem 2.3rem;
		margin-top: 2.6rem;
	}
	.svit {
		background: var(--cream-hi);
	}
	.svithead {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.svit h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem);
		max-width: 22ch;
	}
	.badge {
		font-family: var(--display);
		font-size: 1rem;
		background: var(--mustard);
		color: var(--ink);
		border: 3px solid var(--ink);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
		transform: rotate(1.5deg);
	}
	.svit p {
		margin-top: 0.9rem;
	}
	.schools {
		list-style: none;
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
	}
	.schools li {
		font-family: var(--display);
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		border: 3px solid var(--ink);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 0.45rem 1.1rem;
		background: var(--lacquer);
		color: var(--cream);
	}
	.schools li:nth-child(2) {
		background: var(--green);
	}
	.schools li:nth-child(3) {
		background: var(--mustard);
		color: var(--ink);
	}
	.afternote {
		margin-top: 1.4rem;
		color: rgba(42, 39, 35, 0.85);
	}
	.pair {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2.6rem;
	}
	@media (max-width: 780px) {
		.pair {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
	.panel--green {
		background: var(--green);
		color: var(--cream);
	}
	.panel--lacquer {
		background: var(--lacquer);
		color: var(--cream);
	}
	h2 {
		font-size: 1.65rem;
	}
	.pair p {
		margin-top: 0.6rem;
	}
	.big {
		font-family: var(--display);
		font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4rem);
		color: var(--mustard);
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}
</style>
